  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 225d9ba1d6472414ca12190972df08df, type: 3}
  m_Name: tutorial_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  loadState: 0
  questId: 
  tutorialId: 
  tutorialSlides:
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 4d26d591a39287f429b1b812bb30c2a8, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: Ready to start your adventure? You can move Chemy around
      with the WASD Key.
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: a0aae97a9558d2842a19a869ce110757, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: In some maps you can use your mouse to move the camera.
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 1db2a4bcff447ed498aa2d14c08266c8, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: "Pressing \u201CJ\u201D wil open up your journal. Here you
      can read more about specific herbs and potions."
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 38e46cae0766fca4a835ef73688765aa, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: Pressing the Star label on the side of the journal will
      open up your quest log. Here you can find available quest and their details.
      Clicking the track button will pin the quest in your main HUD.
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: b9dfe6b2e17189546adc23485c392c72, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: Pressing the Question Mark label on the side of the journal
      will open up the tutorial page. Here, you can review all of the tutorial you
      have seen if you ever get confuse.
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 5495bdb2854ac664cac0dcaab9913b86, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: Pressing the Magnifying Glass label on the side of the journal
      will return you to the glossary.
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 96e7325700c31874fbb87528475eee49, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: "When you are near an intractable object, a bubble will
      appear next to Chemy. Pressing \u201CE\u201D will allow you to interact with
      it."
  - tutorialTitle: "Welcome to A\u2019ea"
    tutorialVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 2eee8bc70fbf3e04790ee780c20a0ac5, type: 3}
    tutorialDescription: "Press \u201CEsc\u201D will bring out the pause menu. You
      can change the settings, read the credits and exit to main menu from this menu."
